                    <div class="font-semibold text-indigo-300 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> Interactive Physics Challenges</span>
                        <span id="challenge-step-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-indigo-900 text-indigo-200 rounded text-[10px]">Task 1/3</span>
                    </div>
                    <p id="challenge-desc" class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Adjust Analyzer Filter (θ_2) to achieve exactly **25% transmitted intensity** (I_2 = 0.25 I_0) starting from an initial I_1 = 100\% vertically polarized beam.
                    </p>
                    <div class="bg-gray-950 p-2 rounded border border-gray-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-300 flex justify-between">
                        <span>Target: <strong id="target-val">25.0%</strong></span>
