                    <div id="math-formula-step2" class="text-purple-300">I_final = I₁ × cos²(90°) = 0%</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Curriculum Context Tooltips Box -->
            <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 glass-panel p-3 rounded-xl space-y-1">
                <div class="font-semibold text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-1">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-cyan-400"></i> Physics Insight
                </div>
                <p id="insight-text" class="leading-relaxed">
                    Unpolarized light consists of electric fields vibrating in all directions perpendicular to propagation. Passing through a linear filter transmits only vector components aligned with its optical axis.
                </p>
